KONOHAGAKURE — VILLAGE ORIENTATION MAP (DESCRIPTIVE)
New shinobi reference sheet

The village sits within a ring of wooded hills and protective walls, watched over by the Hokage Rock, into which the faces of every Hokage are carved.

Key locations:
- Hokage Residence / Administration Building — central village, mission desk on ground floor.
- Ninja Academy — near the central district; training grounds adjacent.
- Konoha Hospital — Medical Corps headquarters, eastern district.
- Training Grounds (numbered) — Training Ground 3 and the Memorial Stone (KIA cenotaph) to the northwest.
- Ichiraku Ramen — off the main market street; a village institution.
- Clan compounds — Uchiha district (southeast historically), Hyuga, Nara, Aburame, Inuzuka on the outer residential rings.
- Main Gate — southern wall, staffed by the eternal gate guards (Izumo and Kotetsu).

Curfew and restricted zones (ANBU, records archive) are marked in your registration packet. Do not enter restricted training grounds without authorization.
